{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/emaar-new-branded-villas-the-oasis","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":65,"crm_id":"4464","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Address Branded Villas","slug":"emaar-new-branded-villas-the-oasis","display_address":"The Oasis By Emaar","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":13160000,"display_price":"13.16M","lattitude":24.9983375,"longitude":55.2163157,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":6,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Emaar Properties is set to unveil its first-ever branded homes at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/the-oasis-by-emaar/\">The Oasis</a>, Address Branded Villas, redefining luxury living with breathtaking lagoon views, expansive layouts, and world-class amenities. Designed for discerning homeowners, these <strong>4 to 6-bedroom residences</strong> offer an exceptional blend of space, privacy, and exclusivity. With private beaches, palm-lined swimmable lagoons, and 25% park space, The Oasis provides a serene yet sophisticated environment for families and investors alike.</p><p>Strategically located just 19 minutes from Downtown Dubai, this exclusive members-only community boasts sprawling 7,500+ sq. ft. villas with basements, access to four championship golf courses, and premium waterfront living. New branded villas by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar </a>represent an unparalleled opportunity in one of Dubai’s most sought-after destinations. Register now to secure priority access and experience a new era of luxury.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Emaar_New_Branded_Vllas_at_The_Oasis_a1d8ecc