anquil blue lagoons, ideal for relaxation and recreation.</li><li>Lush Green Spaces – 25% of the community is dedicated to parks and landscaped areas.</li><li>Access to 4 Championship Golf Courses – Perfect for golf enthusiasts looking for world-class facilities.</li><li>Prime Location – Just 19 minutes from Downtown Dubai, offering seamless connectivity.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1373,"cta":{"id":2147,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Emaar_New_Branded_Vllas_at_The_Oasis_ab6a81206c.jpg","hash":"Emaar_New_Branded_Vllas_at_The_Oasis_ab6a81206c","name":"Emaar New Branded Vllas at The Oasis"},"style":null,"title":"Register Now for Priority Access: Branded Homes at The Oasis","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The Oasis by Emaar is an exclusive waterfront community designed for those seeking a luxurious lifestyle amidst serene landscapes. Featuring lush green spaces, private beaches, and palm-lined swimmable lagoons, it offers a harmonious blend of nature and modern living. With world-class amenities, including access to four championship golf courses, this master-planned development is set to redefine premium living in Dubai. The new branded villas at The Oasis by Emaar present a rare opportunity for investors and homeowners to experience resort-style elegance in one of the most sought-after communities in the region.</p><ul><li>IMG Worlds of Adventure – 12 minutes</li><li>Global Village – 15 minutes</li><li>Meydan Racecourse – 15 minutes</li><li>Dubai Hills Golf Club – 17 minutes</li><li>Mall of the Emirates – 18 minutes</li><li>Downtown Dubai – 19 minutes</li><li>Dubai Marina – 20 minutes</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3713,"url":null,"file":null,"item":[],"image":null},